item.description:
It&#039;s hard to believe that *anyone* takes Donald Trump seriously.
It&#039;s a tough to be a voter right now, to have a free (but limited) choice of people to vote for.
So, what if the FBI takes down Hillary (they&#039;ve hated both she and Bill, since the Clinton Whitehouse days). Is it Birnie vs. Trump then?

In the Tao Te Ching translated by Robert Brookes, Chapter 72 starts: &quot;When the people do not fear consequences for their actions, then great disaster follows.&quot;

I would say that we are THERE right now, and in the coming November elections.

But what would Forrest Gump say about us: &quot;Stupid IS, as stupid DOES!&quot;
